d black;" data-ref="d2db25fe-286d-431b-bf89-3f26c80fcee8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="c1c40ea3-65cd-416a-b33c-37d73b21cc62"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="f2095d6f-42d4-4e16-9885-dcf98cfd48c7"><p data-ref="f3fa550f-13ba-420d-9bf3-c8037d88e27d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The Spy Academy is implementing a new system to manage information about their agents. As part of this system, they need to create a class to represent an agent. Imagine yourself as the chief developer, and your task is to design a basic class named <strong data-ref="bdd353af-a245-4769-938d-fe494d90db89">Agent</strong>.</p><p data-ref="8010a6ff-0821-4b5c-add7-6bdfb87571e4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="5575f6b3-003d-4683-b39e-2ed86f5f3168"></p><p data-ref="4ee55ce0-4c92-436b-905b-b358f3415358" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="9a18800b-fbeb-4331-a390-df75cc391ce2">Task:</strong></p><p data-ref="7619b8e6-ec23-4a31-b66d-22ac69a00be4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-r