a2d5efa9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="4019bbab-1e2f-4098-92b4-6e5cf80e2bf4" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="71a8b5f3-4a31-428d-9f47-174ee38dffff"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="f1137ad1-6dc4-437b-b471-076329f25de9"><p data-ref="3c61c1cd-88ae-409e-9f6b-d557495f102a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program to show multilevel inheritance to manage student information and calculate their marks. The program should include the following functionalities:</p><p data-ref="47cc7ed0-fd59-49b8-99ff-e720f3bf25f7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="4c7f8da6-9912-4a6b-af37-3856463355c7">Student Class:</strong></p><p data-ref="166a64cf-946b-432a-bac2-16d624b688f5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">This class should contain two attributes:</p><ul data-ref="b475b9d1-b30a-4adc-a1ee-5d39a8d79044" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="0d5ae005-b111-4465-a125-8848dfdc301f"><strong data-ref="4a3a3edc-423c-4298-877e-f984900839d3">id (int)</strong>: Represents the student's ID.</li><li data-ref="f3a50ec9-afee-474b-807a-449821ea2d03"><strong data-ref="ed628e5b-6c51-476d-a083-a31759512294">name (String):</strong> Represents the student's name.</li></ul><p data-ref="af12dad7-9a52-42c8-b0bc-a83fe2862d5b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Methods:</p><ul data-ref="025a4c61-05fb-4ef5-8031-9af6ff8a4fd8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="36cdfd10-ab28-4094-8ac6-b176648f7fac"><strong data-ref="3fc63b5e-6e3c-46fb-8d1a-c270e83ffa00">setData(int id, String name): </strong>To set the student's ID and name.</li><li data-ref="086ac785-0e3c-48cb-bf17-4f2d39daca00"><strong data-ref="b8b90265-9bc6-4c39-b005-cfd6c31f0c64">displayData():</strong> To display the student's ID and name.</li></ul><p data-ref="b7d5fd9f-76ef-4e93-904c-a2a2d1985ea9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0"