om:1px solid black;" data-ref="7b3a0ccd-8bd6-452e-9e6b-8c19b3077522" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="eacc89d6-d8cb-4937-b2ea-2031b9ce68ed"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="89a21813-0186-4f38-8f60-6ebe406462ce"><p data-ref="f5dcb8a9-3ed1-40bf-839e-f22b8febe645" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Design an abstract class named <strong data-ref="73bb17e3-7ca0-4859-bca7-2de282be812f">Shape</strong> to represent geometric shapes. The <strong data-ref="38665ecf-cd99-4dca-8526-1278ae3c9817">Shape</strong> class should declare the following abstract methods:</p><ul data-ref="dbaa959d-f1cb-4df5-8788-060ec5600243" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="07939a1a-0010-46a8-bad6-fcc4962fd101"><strong data-ref="ba84220d-86ed-480d-a8f3-86f08b206f31">double calculateArea(</strong>): Calculates and returns the area of the shape.</li><li data-ref="d3cf0200-ca1b-4bbb-8c8e-31648b07b9e2"><strong data-ref="c06ec04c-4aa5-4b41-8e38-db599735e63d">double calculatePerimeter()</strong>: Calculates and returns the perimeter of the shape.</li></ul><p data-ref="5f558045-180c-4891-b688-57b4bec7d023" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">In addition, implement a concrete method named <strong data-ref="a6b7d508-6851-4f24-abe1-23450fe5bdc4">displayDetails()</strong> that displays the area and perimeter of the shape. Create a subclass named <strong data-ref="7b1be47e-37f8-4311-b163-6a42497ad07c">Circle</strong> that extends the <strong data-ref="3395e426-8e0c-41a5-90c9-bfafb930b572">Shape</strong> class.</p><p data-ref="a644e3b0-5ce9-422e-84df-f915faaa238d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e5f8857e-e08b-4b2e-9c04-93bf2a7558b7"></p><p data-ref="b7f461e3-d5fa-4a0c-bd9b-fa85d1542676" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="58a89344-2e62-41f7-af74-a1ba36dc6684">Circle</strong> class should:</p><ul data-ref="29d4368c-614b-48fb-8554-3e3e83f0e23b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="07ac9e52-a94d-4a27-b2aa-2432c855ced9">Store the radius of the circle.</li><li data-ref="cfaf0d64-4b8a-4018-a678-2b489e272473">Implement the <strong data-ref="8f17ad11-3f19-48d7-ac8b-33c32e7f3385">calculateArea()</strong> method to calculate and return the area of the circle.</li><li data-ref="a13d0b75-1fc3-409e-9956-1a952b9c8a11">Implement the <strong data-ref="fd99de3d-081e-483f-991b-83759dcac5ec">calculatePerimeter()</strong> method to calculate and return the perimeter (circumference) of the circle.</li></ul><p data-ref="403d43c1-83a8-441b-bade-9041ad175caf" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="0e5c6406-9318-415e-b298-f160548b4a32"></p><p data-ref="26fd5ce2-9410-48a9-9e0f-1aa089ed2fd2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a3f6984a-cd2c-4bf8-9ef6-11c552ee9d8c">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="f853ed1a-de06-42d1-9db7-683c3b60e8cd" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="16c4cf0c-a031-4c9e-9e17-e1fdb0d87c66">The first line reads an integer representing the radius of the circle on the same line after the prompt:</li></ul><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="820cdc30-13ef-416b-b558-b1c3bcb2f5e