style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="22802b19-1766-430a-bb22-218e1825ac4b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="d5258cac-d6ae-494c-a460-a18bec0f925d"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="42a7e30d-248c-4a8b-a4cf-102ad2c34653"><p data-ref="1613c5e5-af79-4a40-bf65-c2d269b2abe9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">You are required to implement the <strong data-ref="db0c2f97-66a9-4401-8c29-f37f8e51586f">Circle</strong> class, which demonstrates multiple inheritance using interfaces. The provided <strong data-ref="be439340-d034-4c30-9c27-fd5df9c97da6">Shape</strong> and <strong data-ref="933cfbbe-0c59-4f75-89b5-f2c9c1fc5572">Color</strong> interfaces define methods that need to be implemented within the <strong data-ref="3d63155f-78d0-4860-8982-5ed963443e38">Circle</strong> class.</p><p data-ref="7abaa768-b4a6-4ed7-b654-5c427152685e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="292d4fed-255d-4d83-8c23-faa1e4613fe8"></p><p data-ref="578c8847-8c6e-43b8-a47e-aa99b4383a41" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. <strong data-ref="5ab939f8-c20e-4d8b-a14b-2799054a90ef">Shape</strong> Interface:</p><p data-ref="72a6156b-2973-472b-95b7-45ab1332f75e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="220baa46-90b4-4e2b-a0fb-4d5607afc5a2">Shape</strong> Interface contains two methods:</p><ul data-ref="dbcef6ed-bc3c-4e1a-a1ea-f46d73c26e4b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="5cf38d2a-7123-44da-9fb4-35e7d9c21bfc"><strong data-ref="c53e047c-891d-4d6d-9e2f-8e484c233d67">double calculateArea():</strong> To calculate the area of the circle.</li><li data-ref="a36cd9aa-5ba5-4620-934d-9d0cf4e19704"><strong data-ref="fd5fdfaf-2f93-4f8d-aa11-1f6f059cf439">double calculatePerimeter():</strong> To calculate the perimeter of the circle.</li></ul><p data-ref="a2b1bb6f-90dd-4163-9fb5-76f56af47011" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="daec1628-9c59-4bdd-9d6a-6bdf4231fa09">Color</strong> Interface contains one method:</p><ul data-ref="521ec8b0-f246-4af6-9fb4-2bc28a83ae1a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data