der-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="de7b35fc-7b2e-4223-b009-0f8924d389eb" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="6766c0d4-d44d-4a7c-89a5-0f8a5d145776"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="30af2e01-5760-456c-b360-bc4f051cc97c"><p data-ref="bb7b2da7-dec5-48c6-b81d-9e67ad95d7f2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program that creates two threads, <strong data-ref="5d6d2e43-8103-4606-b2a7-23b1facfeae8">FirstThread</strong> and <strong data-ref="ca84aa88-b6cf-4de6-b780-5cc4a711bea1">SecondThread</strong>, to print messages a specified number of times with a 100 ms delay.</p><ul data-ref="76b1b47a-2da5-4308-b7a7-8ee037d7c2ae" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="c2d4546a-d834-495a-a5ef-e58ecac42dd7">The program should prompt the user to enter the number of messages for the First Thread and the Second Thread.</li><li data-ref="b9364a90-d362-46d0-9212-353eacf9f4d7"><strong data-ref="e83f9df1-fc2d-4f0c-ac6f-e80bda21047b">FirstThread</strong> should print messages as “Message from First Thread: &lt;i&gt;” where &lt;i&gt; is the current iteration.</li><li data-ref="12c9e605-29a3-44c7-9310-e6e7125c689e"><strong data-ref="d4bc8bc9-b968-47cd-bb57-ea7c34a162d4">SecondThread</strong> should print messages as “Message from Second Thread: &lt;i&gt;” where &lt;i&gt; is the current iteration.</li><li data-ref="f287e040-56be-48d6-9237-91c395550911">The main thread should:</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="5d489314-e749-45ed-8725-f7fdac81d8de">Start both threads using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="7f0fa0a4-e14a-4324-b821-18df6729cf3d">start()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="1baa3730-60e6-478a-8621-5cf563536b36">Display their alive status using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="5c5fa014-0eca-4e32-bff7-5fbe468e1dfb">isAlive()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="dd547703-74a7-48e0-b067-ec50c9eb4e1d">Wait for each thread to finish using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="d2f1e4a9-5744-465f-8b87-40f876fcb6d2">join()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="6ac4bfcd-c932-4eec-8f32-fe2acbe20d89">Display messages while waiting and after completion.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="22c28432-4e0d-4ea4-af9c-e87be66701d1">Verify and display the alive status of threads after they complete.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="3518e8e7-b360-448a-af46-fda270f32086">Print a final message indicating the main thread has finished.</li><li data-ref="a3fdaf95-4836-4226-80c3-a2614d6d2f6d">Both threads should properly handle <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="0177e1a7-dfab-463c-868b-abea18c9c16f">InterruptedException</span> during sleep.</li></ul><p data-ref="fb3b31a9-deb6-4f71-ad91-53129842a66c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="b93f775e-a91e-484f-9d11-ef8963f9c2fe"></p><p data-ref="b1bbd8bf-0437-469a-8b15-709918a914e5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" da